MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 Counter_Count
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 5 )
END

Counter_Count [ 2 ]
BEGIN
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 0 L3
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 0 L2
 
L2 
MOVE TEMP 2 0

 JUMP L4
L3 
PRINT TEMP 1


MOVE TEMP 2 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
RETURN TEMP 5
END ( TEMP 3 MINUS TEMP 1 1 )


L4 NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END

